# Python service images are built with the repository root as context so they can
# install libs/python/claims-common. Only send what the images need.
*
!libs/python/
!services/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/venv
**/.venv
**/.env
services/*/data
services/*/ml/models/*.joblib
services/*/tests
